<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - American Freightways upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - American Freightways upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it raised American Freightways Corp to buy from neutral.  </p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 7/64 to 13-5/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
